{"title":"Semimajor axis","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>semimajor axis</b> can be attributed to a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Conic_section\" title=\"Conic section\">conic section</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Circle\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Circle</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Ellipse\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Ellipse</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Parabola\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Parabola</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Hyperbola\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Hyperbola</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Circle\">Circle</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Semimajor_axis&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Circle\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i> See <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Radius\" title=\"Radius\">radius</a> </i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ellipse\">Ellipse</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Semimajor_axis&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Ellipse\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The semimajor axis passes through the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Center\" title=\"Center\">center</a> and one of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Focus\" title=\"Focus\">foci</a> of an <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Ellipse\" title=\"Ellipse\">ellipse</a>, and is half of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Major_axis\" title=\"Major axis\">major axis</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Parabola\">Parabola</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Semimajor_axis&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Parabola\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This is an empty template page which needs to be filled.  You can help us out by finding the needed content and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Semimajor_axis&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Hyperbola\">Hyperbola</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Semimajor_axis&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Hyperbola\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This is an empty template page which needs to be filled.  You can help us out by finding the needed content and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Semimajor_axis&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p><p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Semimajor_axis&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017221915\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: 